{"4149900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hue Quest", "steam_appid": 4149900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version: Beta 2.5.5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're now a wanted individual by an underground agency as you continue to find out their secrets and reason to their collapse just because you hacked into and opened a cleverly disguised executable file. You do your best to keep your IP masked and your generator online, any sort of connection to the outside world would expose your location and risk your entire operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain doors are opened from specifc scores by matching your selected colour with the background based on a timeframe, you find out these specific scores by searching around your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the program guide your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is a Steam requirement and HQ doesn't have at least 90% of the content mentioned above due to early access!)</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version: Beta 2.5.5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're now a wanted individual by an underground agency as you continue to find out their secrets and reason to their collapse just because you hacked into and opened a cleverly disguised executable file. You do your best to keep your IP masked and your generator online, any sort of connection to the outside world would expose your location and risk your entire operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain doors are opened from specifc scores by matching your selected colour with the background based on a timeframe, you find out these specific scores by searching around your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the program guide your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is a Steam requirement and HQ doesn't have at least 90% of the content mentioned above due to early access!)</p>", "short_description": "Hue Quest is a 3D/2D point and click adventure game where you uncover a lost story by hacking into a heavily guarded underground agency. You continue to do so all while doing everything in your power to keep your operation hidden to avoid being shut down, using the tools provided at your disposal.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149900/819a65953f9c03dcf23bc94c29434e8258888ee1/header.jpg?t=1786672751", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149900/8b8d6c9f03d0bd8b479f4a68cf534075baaa238b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786672751", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149900/8b8d6c9f03d0bd8b479f4a68cf534075baaa238b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786672751", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 335 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["quwuesadillas", "cannon_bacon", "konnah_oppenheimer"], "publishers": ["Zackiel Opheim"], "price_overview": {"currency": "